{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o015b","title":"田景趋董卓尸被吕布杀","accounts":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o015b-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"田景趋董卓尸被吕布杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o015b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"dongyuan-p0011","role":"趋尸被杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o015b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"诛杀","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o015b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":192,"label":"诛董卓时","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"dongyuan-y192","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"dongyuan-q-o014","basis":"诛董卓时"},"evidence":["dongyuan-e-o015b-q","dongyuan-q-o014","wudi-q-o019","wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-o015b-q","source_order":[6,119,"O015b"],"order":1538}],"persons":[{"id":"dongyuan-p0011","name":"田景","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o015"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"dongyuan-m-o015-dongyuan-p0011","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o015"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o015b-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-f9747e419c3e6d3b3ded","layer":"original","quote":"主簿田景前趋卓尸，布又杀之。凡所杀三人，余莫敢动。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":86,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o014","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-5984b2e3802609b7e084","layer":"original","quote":"三年四月〖1〗，司徒王允、尚书仆射士孙瑞、卓将吕布共谋诛卓〖2〗。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o015","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-f9747e419c3e6d3b3ded","layer":"original","quote":"是时，天子有疾新愈，大会未央殿。布使同郡骑都尉李肃等，将亲兵十余人，伪著卫士服，守掖门。布怀诏书。卓至，肃等格卓；卓惊呼：“布所在〖3〗？”布曰：“有诏！”遂杀卓，夷三族。主簿田景前趋卓尸，布又杀之。凡所杀三人，余莫敢动。﹝一﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3863a19b555811d1f415","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：初平三年（公元 192）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2063caf2b642ce9ff2bc","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o019","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖1〗，太祖军顿丘，毒等攻东武阳。太祖乃引兵西入山，攻毒等本屯〖2〗。﹝一﹞毒闻之，弃武阳还〖3〗。太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
